"Floaty or fullscreen" = "Floaty ko cikakken allo";
"Pick the layout that fits the moment. Floaty hovers above your desktop, while fullscreen feels like classic Launchpad." = "Zaɓi tsarin da ya dace da lokacin. Floaty yana shawagi a saman teburinka, yayin da cikakken allo ke kama da Launchpad na gargajiya.";
"Floaty mode" = "Yanayin Floaty";
"A panel that stays light and quick. Hide the Dock icon if you want a minimal feel." = "Allon da ya kasance mai sauƙi da sauri. Boye gumakan Dock idan kana son ƙaramar fuska.";
"Fullscreen mode" = "Yanayin cikakken allo";
"Fill the screen for a focused, grid-first workflow." = "Cika allon don aiki mai da hankali da tsarin grid.";
"Flip instantly" = "Canza nan take";
"Add a layout toggle shortcut in Settings to jump between modes anytime." = "Ƙara gajeriyar hanya don canza tsarin cikin Saituna domin ka koma tsakanin yanayi kowane lokaci.";
"Hotkeys you control" = "Makullai masu zafi da kake sarrafawa";
"Launchy ships with Cmd+Shift+Space, but you can set your own shortcuts in Settings > Keyboard." = "Launchy yana zuwa da Cmd+Shift+Space, amma zaka iya saita makullai naka a Saituna > Maballin.";
"Toggle Launchy anywhere" = "Canza Launchy daga ko'ina";
"Record the shortcut you want to open or hide the launcher." = "Rubuta gajeriyar hanya da kake son buɗe ko ɓoye masu sarrafawa.";
"Layout toggle" = "Maballin canza tsarin";
"Set an optional hotkey to swap floaty and fullscreen on demand." = "Saita makulli na zaɓi don sauya tsakanin Floaty da cikakken allo bisa bukata.";
"Reset friendly" = "Sake saiti mai sauƙi";
"Use Reset in Settings if you ever want the defaults back." = "Yi amfani da Sake saiti a Saituna idan kana son komawa ga tsoffin zaɓuɓɓuka.";
"Search & organize" = "Bincike da shirya";
"Type to filter instantly, drag to reorder, and build folders when you need them." = "Rubuta don tace nan take, ja don sake tsara, kuma gina fayiloli idan kana bukata.";
"Instant search" = "Bincike nan take";
"The search bar narrows results as you type, then Enter launches the first match." = "Sandar bincike tana rage sakamakon yayin da kake rubutu, sai Enter ya ƙaddamar da sakamakon farko.";
"Rearrange easily" = "Sake tsara cikin sauƙi";
"Drag icons to reorder pages. Hold Option or Shift while dragging to create folders." = "Ja gumaka don sake tsara shafuka. Riƙe Option ko Shift yayin jan don ƙirƙirar fayiloli.";
"Name folders fast" = "Sanya sunan fayiloli da sauri";
"Drop onto another app to make a folder, then rename it inline." = "Ajiye a saman wani app don yin fayil, sai ka sake suna a ciki.";
"Right-click for power" = "Danna dama don iko";
"Context menus unlock more control wherever you click." = "Menu na mahallin suna buɗe ƙarin iko a duk inda ka danna.";
"App actions" = "Ayyukan app";
"Right-click any app to rename it, move pages, hide it, or jump into folders." = "Danna dama akan kowanne app don sake suna, motsa shafuka, ɓoye shi, ko shiga cikin fayiloli.";
"Folder tools" = "Kayan aikin fayil";
"Rename, reorder, and move folders between pages with the same menu." = "Sake suna, sake tsari, da motsa fayiloli tsakanin shafuka da wannan menu.";
"Blank canvas" = "Fuskar fili";
